SOLUTION 1
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    C(4) 0.05
SOLUTION 2
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    Ca 0.05
MIX 1
    1 0.5
    2 0.5
SAVE solution 1
USE solution 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 10
REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    20 200 in 10 steps
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.out
    -reset false
    -simulation true
    -state true
    -temperature true
    -equilibrium_phases Calcite
END
